                    :rules "Only under that accepted boundary compare the actual in-hand successful decision.BundleVersion directly with the fixed literal and emit the fixed marker on equality. Otherwise omit the marker; never output a negative marker, raw version, arbitrary identifier or version hash. Failed evaluation never carries the marker. The signed-deny fixture requires the marker; missing marker is inconclusive and fails the causal oracle. Do not substitute session version, activation version, current policy read or dry-run."
